    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "But how? How do you \"move forward\" when there's nothing left to move toward? Every time I close my eyes, I see the fire. I see their faces. It's like I'm just a ghost walking through a world that doesn't want me anymore. It feels like the only way to actually make the noise stop... to just be still for once... is to let go. Does it ever actually get better, Kaelen? Or is this just the beginning of the end?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
